---
Alias for `vendo profile switch`

Usage: vendo config use [OPTIONS] [profile]

Arguments:
  [profile]  

Options:
      --account <accountId>  Switch by account ID instead of profile name
      --profile <name>       Use a specific account profile
      --debug                Enable verbose request diagnostics
  -h, --help                 Print help

Examples:
  $ vendo config use <profile>
  $ vendo config use --account <accountId>
